    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/b489ff1a64d51475b09e52617b8609c5.poster.avif?t=1738083720\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/b489ff1a64d51475b09e52617b8609c5.apng?t=1738083720\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=100 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/980fc76d3fb617c162fef6284b0b965a.poster.avif?t=1738083720\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/980fc76d3fb617c162fef6284b0b965a.apng?t=1738083720\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=80 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/c3395f15c4ffd4287dcc3fd15fc20a7a.poster.avif?t=1738083720\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/c3395f15c4ffd4287dcc3fd15fc20a7a.apng?t=1738083720\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=80 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/284aab278f79af26583c3af57f221fba.poster.avif?t=1738083720\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/284aab278f79af26583c3af57f221fba.apng?t=1738083720\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poultry Party!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash across the stovetop and fend off the flames! Play as 1 of 4 colorful critters and try to survive as long as possible by running, jumping, and dodging. All characters play the same, so don't overthink it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/78d0cbf862a5f8f4755eac2725d27b91.avif?t=1738083720\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hazards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as the stove is on, all sorts of flamming threats will fly in to scorch you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's a few of them:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/b26eccd5efb0957524da6c9275aaf3de.poster.avif?t=1738083720\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/b26eccd5efb0957524da6c9275aaf3de.apng?t=1738083720\" class=\"bb_img\" width=60 height=80 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/f657e350211eff4d579fbac157b47e2c.poster.avif?t=1738083720\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/f657e350211eff4d579fbac157b47e2c.apng?t=1738083720\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=60 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/5994022e47b67ef2df1f342da2857005.poster.avif?t=1738083720\" width=170 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/5994022e47b67ef2df1f342da2857005.webm?t=1738083720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 Fire\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Cross Fire\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Coal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br>Each has unique capabilities and behaviors that you'll figure out as you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may even discover more types as you progress...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Projectiles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/3c5cbda7fb232cd1a57fbe8a208408b9.avif?t=1738083720\" width=64 height=64 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/eb9ff1453f1dc86c0b67babbafa98a8c.avif?t=1738083720\" width=64 height=64 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/eacf267ad406af765b5d993cf16cc875.avif?t=1738083720\" width=64 height=64 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/1dc9f294bcc89b6dd9d367169a08bbae.avif?t=1738083720\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 Egg\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Milk\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Mud\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Water</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't think you have to bend a knee to the flames; you can fight back! Animals can throw projectiles that extinguish most fires instantly! Just know that some hazards are resistant or even immune to the effects of these projectiles. You won't know til' you throw!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The angle and distance of your throw is primarily determined by your directional input, but it's also influenced by your character's velocity. Expiriment holding different directions when throwing to learn what you're capable of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mashers beware! Throwing projectiles too fast will decrease their range!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an animal gets burned even once, they get cooked into food and are completely immoble. If you're alone when this happens it's game over, but  allies can give you a second chance! Once you get close enough to a cooked ally you can revive them. But you won't be able to move for a brief moment so watch out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/28859f8149aa719706bfcaa4e067cb39.avif?t=1738083720\" width=80 height=64 /></span>&lt;-<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/d7dc076722bdd1bf641b8f0e61f81908.avif?t=1738083720\" width=80 height=64 /></span>\u00a0&lt;-<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/377d68ee9677dfb33525b26746a1a041.avif?t=1738083720\" width=80 height=80 /></span>\u00a0&lt;-\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/bc88f18c6f566b4a13a8e22a88d2e25a.avif?t=1738083720\" width=80 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ally2 Revived\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Ally1 (Alive)\u00a0 \u00a0 Ally2 (Cooked)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based around survival, but it can be beaten. I'd like to tell you how, but it would be way more fun to watch you figure it out yourself. Good luck!</p>",
