70/extras/5994022e47b67ef2df1f342da2857005.webm?t=1738083720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 Fire\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Cross Fire\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Coal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br>Each has unique capabilities and behaviors that you'll figure out as you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may even discover more types as you progress...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Projectiles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/3c5cbda7fb232cd1a57fbe8a208408b9.avif?t=1738083720\" width=64 height=64 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/eb9ff1453f1dc86c0b67babbafa98a8c.avif?t=1738083720\" width=64 height=64 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/eacf267ad406af765b5d993cf16cc875.avif?t=1738083720\" width=64 height=64 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425070/extras/1dc9f294bcc89b6dd9d367169a08bbae.avif?t=1738083720\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 Egg\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Milk\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Mud\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Water</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't think you have to bend a knee to the flames; you can fight back! Animals can throw p